Domain Entity AssessmentItem
    documentation 'This entity represents one of many single measures that make up an assessment. 
    shared string IdentificationCode named IdentificationCode
        documentation 'A unique number or alphanumeric code assigned to a space, room, site, building, 
                      'individual, organization, program, or institution by a school, school system, 
                      'state, or other agency or entity.
        is part of identity
    enumeration AssessmentItemCategory
        documentation 'Category or type of the AssessmentItem. For example:
                      '
                      'Multiple choice
                      '
                      'Analytic
                      '
                      'Prose
                      '
                      '....
        is optional
    integer MaxRawScore
        documentation 'The maximum raw score achievable across all assessment items that are correct and scored 
                      'at the maximum.
        is optional
    string CorrectResponse
        documentation 'The correct response for the AssessmentItem.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 20
    duration ExpectedTimeAssessed
        documentation 'The duration of time allotted for the AssessmentItem.
        is optional
    string Nomenclature
        documentation 'Reflects the specific nomenclature used for AssessmentItem.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 35
    reference LearningStandard
        documentation 'LearningStandard tested by this item.
        is optional collection
    reference Assessment
        documentation 'Relates the AssessmentItem to an existing assessment.
        is part of identity
